.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ouch 1  "ouch 0.8.1" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ouch \- A command\-line utility for easily compressing and decompressing files and directories.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBouch\fR [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-no\fR] [\fB\-A\fR|\fB\-\-accessible\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-password\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
A command\-line utility for easily compressing and decompressing files and directories.
.PP
Supported formats: tar, zip, gz, 7z, xz, lzma, lzip, bz/bz2, bz3, lz4, sz (Snappy), zst, rar and br.
.PP
Repository: https://github.com/ouch\-org/ouch
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to yes
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-no\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to no
.TP
\fB\-A\fR, \fB\-\-accessible\fR
Activate accessibility mode, reducing visual noise
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Silence output
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Specify the format of the archive
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-password\fR \fI<PASSWORD>\fR
Decompress or list with password
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR
Concurrent working threads
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR
Disable the process sandbox
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ouch\-compress(1)
Compress one or more files into one output file
.TP
ouch\-decompress(1)
Decompresses one or more files, optionally into another folder
.TP
ouch\-list(1)
List contents of an archive
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.8.1
